  "question": {
    "text": "A sphere is rolling without slipping on a fixed horizontal plane surface. In the figure, $A$ is the point of contact. $B$ is the centre of the sphere and $C$ is its topmost point. Then,\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/7Xsr-fGTyJjgVVwNEX_nZqDunz93zW95YxOhMA7BOEM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "qG5K3",
      "text": "\n$\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_C-\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_A=2\\left(\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_B-\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_C\\right)$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "BKgXd",
      "text": "\n$\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_C-\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_B=\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_B-\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_A$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "cTo0Y",
      "text": "\n$\\left|\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_C-\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_A\\right|=2\\left|\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_B-\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_C\\right|$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "0VNj0",
      "text": "\n$\\left|\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_C-\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_A\\right|=4\\left|\\overrightarrow{\\mathbf{v}}_B\\right|$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\nv_A=0, v_B=v \\text { and } v_C=2 v\n$$\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/CyOWdRHTYq2MSjWUtaeoFm7lHACpL2peoHF_5bBE4g8.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
